{"id":"ecff451f7a97dd8d","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-rps-orthogonal.md","title":"递归程序方案正交且合流","display":"thm-rps-orthogonal — 递归程序方案正交且合流","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-rps-orthogonal","aliases":["56-thm-rps-orthogonal"],"display":"thm-rps-orthogonal — 递归程序方案正交且合流","depends_on":["[[56-df-recursive-program-scheme]]","[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-thm-orthogonal-confluent]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), remark after Definition 3.4.7 and Chapter 4, printed p77","source_ocr_block":"98","verification_status":"source-claim-compared; local-reduction-to-orthogonality-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-rps-orthogonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-rps-orthogonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rps-orthogonal — 递归程序方案正交且合流"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d754a1c4c76d6038\" href=\"?note=d754a1c4c76d6038\" title=\"56-df-recursive-program-scheme\">56-df-recursive-program-scheme</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b90aafd738db3274\" href=\"?note=b90aafd738db3274\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-confluent\">56-thm-orthogonal-confluent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), remark after Definition 3.4.7 and Chapter 4, printed p77"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"98"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-claim-compared; local-reduction-to-orthogonality-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Confluent}\">\\(\\mathrm{Confluent}\\)</span> 见对应本地节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,\\to_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,\\to_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.4.7 后的说明（印刷 p77，OCR 页块98），结合 §4.1。左线性来自参数互异；非根位置只有变量，根位置不同定义符号不能合一，同一符号又仅有一条规则。故排除平凡根自重叠后无重叠，再应用正交合流定理。此结论本身不包含终止性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-recursive-program-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"d754a1c4c76d6038","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-recursive-program-scheme]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"b90aafd738db3274","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-orthogonal-confluent]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RPS}(\\Sigma,V,R,D,C)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Confluent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,\\to_R).","display":true}],"bytes":1188,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-rps-orthogonal.md]]"}],"outgoing":["d754a1c4c76d6038","34fb9d07dfbad48c","b90aafd738db3274"]}